WEBVTT

00:00:06.559 --> 00:00:10.772
Well, it sounds to me like
you are way better off without that...

00:00:10.855 --> 00:00:13.816
That total super-jerk dinkleschplatt!

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.195
Exactly. Total super-jerk dinkleschplatt!

00:00:17.278 --> 00:00:18.947
BUSTER: Rosita! Gunter! You're on next!

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:20.031
Yeah, okay, here.

00:00:20.114 --> 00:00:21.699
There should be some gum
or some candy in there somewhere.

00:00:21.783 --> 00:00:22.784
Just help yourself.

00:00:23.576 --> 00:00:24.994
Rosita! Rosita! Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:00:26.037 --> 00:00:27.372
Can I take your place, please?

00:00:27.455 --> 00:00:28.414
-(POP MUSIC PLAYING)
-Sure, Johnny, go ahead.

00:00:28.498 --> 00:00:31.876
Okay, get ready,
'cause I'm warning you... (CHUCKLES)

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:35.546
This stage is about to explode
with major piggy power!

00:00:36.256 --> 00:00:39.259
I am so sorry. I have no control.

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:40.969
Oh!

00:00:42.095 --> 00:00:43.137
Yeah!

00:00:43.972 --> 00:00:46.140
Okay, come on, you can do this.

00:00:46.224 --> 00:00:47.934
(SINGING POP SONG)

00:00:51.104 --> 00:00:52.105
(GRUNTS)

00:00:52.605 --> 00:00:53.648
Are you okay?

00:00:54.274 --> 00:00:55.858
Oh, yes, I'm fine, thank you.

00:00:56.526 --> 00:00:57.735
How are you?

00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:59.904
Okay, Johnny! Let's get you out here!

00:00:59.988 --> 00:01:02.782
And you guys,
you've got to work on that routine!

00:01:02.865 --> 00:01:04.242
Take it away, Johnny!

00:01:04.325 --> 00:01:05.451
(PIANO PLAYING)

00:01:05.535 --> 00:01:09.580
(SINGING R&B SONG)

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:15.920
(PLAYS WRONG NOTE)

00:01:16.296 --> 00:01:19.799
You can't just sing it,
you've got to show the fire and desire!

00:01:19.882 --> 00:01:22.385
(NASALLY) The fire went out a long time ago.

00:01:22.468 --> 00:01:25.638
-What?
-Look, I can't even keep count of the steps!

00:01:25.805 --> 00:01:27.765
Ugh! Counting schmounting!

00:01:27.849 --> 00:01:30.518
She sings too much with her head, right?

00:01:31.561 --> 00:01:32.603
Ja, ja, see?

00:01:32.687 --> 00:01:34.856
Forget the steps and just like...

00:01:34.939 --> 00:01:37.442
Let the music take control of your body parts.

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:41.237
My body parts are not responding,
okay? It's never gonna happen.

00:01:42.447 --> 00:01:43.823
I should just be getting groceries.

00:01:43.906 --> 00:01:45.575
-Rosita, no...
-Rosita, come on!

00:01:45.658 --> 00:01:47.076
Please, like, don't go.

00:01:48.745 --> 00:01:51.581
MIKE: Psst! Hey! Hey! Down here.

00:01:52.832 --> 00:01:54.959
Have you seen three
nasty-looking bears out there?

00:01:56.336 --> 00:01:58.212
-Uh, no.
-Oh, great.

00:01:58.296 --> 00:02:00.548
Hey, by the way, I love your act. Seriously.

00:02:00.631 --> 00:02:02.342
The part where you fall flat on your face...

00:02:02.425 --> 00:02:05.011
(LAUGHS) That cracks me up every time.

00:02:05.094 --> 00:02:06.387
See you around, porky.

00:02:07.764 --> 00:02:12.894
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:02:16.022 --> 00:02:17.023
Aw, man.

00:02:17.273 --> 00:02:19.442
Johnny, uh, I know I'm asking a lot of you...

00:02:19.525 --> 00:02:21.444
Mr. Moon, I'm really trying, I promise.

00:02:22.111 --> 00:02:24.155
What about your backup song?
Have you practiced that?

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:26.199
Uh, well, not yet.

00:02:26.282 --> 00:02:29.327
Well, why don't we go back
and work on that one, okay?

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:33.331
I mean, look, if you play like that
in front of Nana Noodleman...

00:02:35.249 --> 00:02:36.292
Johnny?

00:02:42.048 --> 00:02:43.049
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:45.718
-(HORN HONKS)
-Hey!

00:02:47.512 --> 00:02:48.513
(BRAKES SCREECH)

00:02:55.561 --> 00:02:57.188
(INDISTINCT ARGUING)

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:04.445
(LAUGHTER ECHOING)

00:03:04.529 --> 00:03:06.948
BIG DADDY: We are set for life now, boys!

00:03:07.281 --> 00:03:09.409
Oh. Oh. What's going on?

00:03:09.492 --> 00:03:10.493
Where's Johnny?

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:11.828
He's not here.

00:03:13.579 --> 00:03:14.664
-(SIREN WAILING)
-(GASPS)

00:03:15.081 --> 00:03:16.249
Run!

00:03:26.384 --> 00:03:28.219
(HORN BLARING)

00:03:28.428 --> 00:03:30.596
Oh! I'm dead.

00:03:31.931 --> 00:03:33.683
(ASH SINGING BALLAD)

00:03:42.191 --> 00:03:43.860
Okay, wait, let me see...

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:45.486
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:49.991
(CONTINUES SINGING)

00:03:52.201 --> 00:03:54.078
No, Mom, I have not made any friends.

00:03:54.162 --> 00:03:55.788
What do you think this is, kindergarten?

00:03:55.872 --> 00:03:58.207
If you hadn't squealed to the cops,
I wouldn't be in here right now.

00:03:58.291 --> 00:03:59.417
Honey, when are you getting out?

00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:01.461
I'm only gonna be in here for a few years.

00:04:01.544 --> 00:04:02.920
Well, where'd you hide the money?

00:04:03.713 --> 00:04:04.755
Where were you?

00:04:04.839 --> 00:04:07.717
Um, well, the thing is, I went to get gas...

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:08.801
Don't lie to me!

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.637
Um, I was at a rehearsal.

00:04:11.888 --> 00:04:13.931
Rehearsal? For what?

00:04:14.348 --> 00:04:17.018
(SIGHS) I was at a singing contest.

00:04:18.644 --> 00:04:19.770
Look, Dad...

00:04:20.354 --> 00:04:23.065
I'm sorry, I just don't want to be in your gang.

00:04:23.149 --> 00:04:24.400
I want to be a singer.

00:04:24.484 --> 00:04:26.486
-Singer?
-Look, Dad, no, it's okay.

00:04:26.569 --> 00:04:27.778
I can get the bail money.

00:04:27.862 --> 00:04:29.822
There's a prize. It's $100,000.

00:04:29.906 --> 00:04:31.032
(LOUD THUD)

00:04:33.743 --> 00:04:36.412
How did I end up with a son like you, eh?

00:04:37.079 --> 00:04:38.664
You're nothing like me.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.292
You never were and you never will be.

00:04:41.375 --> 00:04:44.587
I'll get you out! Dad, wait!
I'll get the money. I promise!

00:04:46.506 --> 00:04:48.174
(MISS CRAWLY HUMMING)

00:05:18.204 --> 00:05:19.247
(CONTINUES HUMMING)

00:05:21.123 --> 00:05:24.544
(SHRIEKS) Johnny!
You gave me a fright there.

00:05:24.627 --> 00:05:26.629
Sorry, I didn't mean to. I just...

00:05:27.255 --> 00:05:30.716
Well, I know it's late, but I could really
use some extra piano lessons.

00:05:30.883 --> 00:05:31.884
(PIANO PLAYING)

00:05:32.009 --> 00:05:33.052
(JOHNNY HUMMING)

00:05:33.386 --> 00:05:34.387
Ah-ha.

00:05:36.097 --> 00:05:37.890
Mmm. That's it.

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:40.768
That's good.

00:05:41.269 --> 00:05:42.478
You're getting it.

00:05:44.438 --> 00:05:46.857
(MUSIC PLAYING OVER PA)

00:05:51.862 --> 00:05:52.863
MAN: (OVER PA) Shoppers are reminded

00:05:52.947 --> 00:05:55.366
the store will close in 15 minutes. Thank you.

00:05:55.449 --> 00:05:56.659
(YAWNS)

00:05:56.951 --> 00:05:58.661
(SPANISH SONG PLAYING OVER PA)

00:06:17.597 --> 00:06:18.598
(MOUTHING)

00:06:57.303 --> 00:06:58.888
MAN: (OVER PA) The lady in aisle six...

00:07:00.931 --> 00:07:02.308
That was awesome.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:04.769
(CLAPPING AND WHISTLING)

00:07:05.728 --> 00:07:06.729
All right.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:10.733
Mr. Moon, are you sure this is legal?

00:07:10.816 --> 00:07:12.693
Uh, I don't know.

00:07:12.777 --> 00:07:15.112
But if you keep asking questions,
we'll never get this done.

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:17.031
Now, hit it!

00:07:18.157 --> 00:07:19.283
-Oh!
-Ahh!

00:07:22.828 --> 00:07:24.080
A little higher.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:27.708
There it is! Thank you!

